/-- Blueprint line 2775 ("the remaining amplitudes lie in `[D_*^{-B}, P^{C₀}]`; their quadruples
number at most `C (1 + log D_* + log P)^4`"): the dyadic exponents `k` with
`lo ≤ 2^k ≤ hi` number at most `log₂(hi/lo) + 1`. -/
theorem dyadic_bins_card {lo hi : ℝ} (hlo : 0 < lo) (hlh : lo ≤ hi) (T : Finset ℤ)
    (hT : ∀ k ∈ T, lo ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ k ∧ (2 : ℝ) ^ k ≤ hi) :
